  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:attah_chonen_leadam">
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">PRAYER FOR UNDERSTANDING</tei:head>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/1"/>You favor man with perception
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/2"/>and teach mankind understanding.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/3"/>(You have favored us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/4"/>[with the ability] to know Your Torah
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/5"/>and taught us to fulfill
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/6"/>the statutes of Your will.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/7"/>You made a distinction, Adonoy, our God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/8"/>between sacred and unhallowed,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/9"/>between light and darkness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/10"/>between Israel and the peoples,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/11"/>between the seventh day
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/12"/>and the six work days.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/13"/>Our Father, our King,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/14"/>commence for us
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/15"/>the days that approach us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/16"/>in peace,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/17"/>devoid of all sin,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/18"/>and cleansed of all iniquity,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/19"/>and devoted to the fear of You.)
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/20"/>And grant us from Your
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/21"/>wisdom, understanding and knowledge.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/22"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:attah_chonen_leadam/23"/>Grantor of perception.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
